"gyswllt' i archwilio sawl ffeil o un cyfeiriadur"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3356
msgid "Unlocks the current view, so that it becomes normal again."
msgstr "Datgloi'r golwg cyfredol, a'i droi'n arferol eto."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3357
msgid ""
"Sets the view as 'linked'. A linked view follows directory changes made in "
